{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着圍繞英偉達的爭議不斷升級，美國國會正加大調查力度。美國參議院銀行委員會主席蒂姆·斯科特近日致函英偉達前行政總裁黃仁勳以及美國商務部長霍華德·盧特尼克，要求兩人分別出席委員會聽證會，就近期引發廣泛關注的英偉達相關事件作出説明。 </p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586226.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:37:10.901733+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:19:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_hash":"8b34306d19dbc756c3de052c973262e868cf32ce3ab9250a7142f0f8a20fb7ee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}